  "description": "IYAWEL crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: (C16 H8 Cl11 O26 Pr4 Sb12 3-)n,3n(C6 H8 N1 1+),4.5n(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Pr1 (Pr) has 6 O neighbors; Pr2 (Pr) has 8 O neighbors; Pr1D (Pr) has 6 O neighbors; Pr1A (Pr) has 4 O neighbors; Pr2A (Pr) has 8 O neighbors; Pr2A_2 (Pr) has 2 O neighbors; Pr2D (Pr) has 2 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 3 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 4.679-4.829 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 119.45-124.01°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula (2-MepyH)3[Pr4Sb12O18Cl11(1,4-bdc)2]·4.5H2O.",
